{"meta":{"id":"class-json-parquet","category":"aide/tutorials","title":"Class-JSON-Parquet 구조 패턴","subtitle":"(파일 기반 데이터 관리)","summary":"구조 정의(클래스) → 상태 영속화(JSON) → 대량 이력(Parquet) 3계층 패턴","tags":["aide","튜토리얼","패턴","데이터구조"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-install","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-50 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-200/60 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>\n      2-tutorials\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Tutorials</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    Class-JSON-Parquet 구조 패턴 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-violet-600 font-serif\">(파일 기반 데이터 관리)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-100 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 구조 정의(클래스) → 상태 영속화(JSON) → 대량 이력(Parquet)으로 나눠 관리하는 파일 기반 데이터 패턴\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">사용 시점</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">별도 DB 서버 없이 파일 시스템만으로 상태를 관리하고 싶을 때</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">데이터가 \"자주 바뀌는 소량 상태\"와 \"계속 쌓이기만 하는 대량 이력\"으로 명확히 나뉠 때</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">나중에 진짜 DB로 옮길 가능성이 있어, 필드를 클래스로 미리 명시해두고 싶을 때</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3.5 bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-amber-900 leading-relaxed\">\n      <strong class=\"font-semibold text-amber-950\">※ 맞지 않는 경우:</strong> <span class=\"bg-amber-100/90 text-amber-950 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold\">동시 쓰기 트래픽이 많거나 복잡한 조인/집계 쿼리가 필요하면</span> 처음부터 진짜 DB(SQLite/Postgres)를 쓰는 게 낫습니다.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">3계층 역할</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">클래스가 곧 스키마</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[24%]\">계층</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 w-[26%]\">형식</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[50%]\">역할</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-violet-700 bg-violet-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[①]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">구조 정의</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">Python dataclass</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">필드/타입/기본값을 코드 한 곳에서 명시</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[②]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">상태 영속화</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">JSON</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">소량, 자주 변경, 사람이 읽기 편함 (계좌 잔고, 설정값 등)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[③]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">대량 이력</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">Parquet</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">대량 append-only, 컬럼형 압축, 분석용 (체결 이력, 시세 등)</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50/80 p-3\">\n    <pre class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-stone-700 font-mono overflow-x-auto\">저장소(Store) 클래스가 JSON/Parquet 파일을 읽고 쓰며\n①의 dataclass 타입으로 변환/역변환한다.\n쓰기는 항상 \"임시 파일 + os.replace\"로 원자적으로 교체 —\n쓰다가 죽어도 파일이 반쪽으로 안 남는다.</pre>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">장점 / 주의사항</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">장점:</strong> IDE 자동완성/타입체크, JSON은 사람이 열어봐도 읽힘, Parquet은 pandas로 바로 분석 재사용, DB 운영 부담 없음</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">주의:</strong> 동시성이 약함(파일 락 없이 여러 프로세스가 쓰면 깨질 수 있음), 조인/집계 쿼리가 없음, 스키마 변경은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">from_dict</code>에서 수동으로 하위호환 처리</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">JSON 항목이 수천 건을 넘어가면 매번 전체 파일을 읽고 다시 쓰는 방식이 느려짐 — 계좌별 파일 분리나 DB 전환을 고려</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Tutorials</span>\n  <span>Class-JSON-Parquet</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/tutorials/class-json-parquet","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"tutorials","title":"2-tutorials (튜토리얼)","path":"aide/tutorials"}],"hasImage":false}